# Commit Messages

When creating git commits:

- Never add `Co-authored-by` trailers naming yourself or any AI agent.
- Never append agent attribution lines (e.g. "Generated by Cursor", "Co-authored-by: Cursor").
- Write commit messages as if the user authored them.

## Example

```
? GOOD:
fix: correct sign in SHM displacement equation

? BAD:
fix: correct sign in SHM displacement equation

Co-authored-by: Cursor <noreply@cursor.com>
```
